OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe hospital is in the middle of
OL,7,     Fone of the worst storms in
OL,8,     Fdecades, but that doesn't stop
OL,9,     Fcasualty being busy. It's not long
OL,10,     Fbefore paramedics bring in the
OL,11,     Fstorm's first victim.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia treats a 22 year-old
OL,14,     Fplumber with a cyst he's had since
OL,15,     Fadolescence, Dr Emma contends with
OL,16,     Fsome large crusty lesions and Dr
OL,17,     FAdil meets an audiologist covered
OL,18,     Fin lipomas.
